 Windows 7 Enhanced edition  (KDE theme pack)
 Enhanced by : Leon Khoo
 Based on    : "Plasma SVG Win7 Theme" by Blackcrack / Blackysgate.de

 The original icon theme and its artwork remain the work of the original
 author. This enhanced edition adds touched-up metadata, a user-level
 install script and further icon refinements, while keeping the original
 authorship and license intact.

 Project components (CC BY-NC-SA)
 --------------------------------
   icons/windows-7-enhanced           icon theme (original artwork by
                                      Blackcrack / Blackysgate.de)
   look-and-feel/windows-7-enhanced   Plasma global theme (look-and-feel)
   color-schemes/Windows7Enhanced     Windows 7 Aero color scheme

 Forked Aero components (GPL-3.0-or-later)
 -----------------------------------------
 These are adapted forks of third-party themes, renamed into the
 windows-7-enhanced namespace. Original authors are credited.

   plasma/desktoptheme/windows-7-enhanced      Plasma theme
                                               (fork of ExposeAir by
                                               Mark Whittaker / Phobian347)
   aurorae/themes/windows-7-enhanced           window decoration
                                               (fork of ExposeAir)
   kvantum/windows-7-enhanced                  Kvantum theme
                                               (fork of ExposeAir's)
   look-and-feel/windows-7-enhanced-splash     splash
                                               (fork of windows7splash by
                                               luis-pseudo / AudacityXD62)
   color-schemes/Windows7EnhancedAero          color scheme
                                               (fork of ExposeAir's)

 Not bundled: the Kvantum engine (install the `kvantum` package).
 Excluded (no clear open license): "Win7Bulid-cursors" cursor theme and the
 original pack's wallpaper images. See LICENSES.md.

 License summary: project files CC BY-NC-SA; forked components GPL-3.0-or-later.
 See COPYING and LICENSES.md.
